<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AMI All Women Interstate Debate - Official Proposal</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        .gradient-bg { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); }
        .gold-accent { color: #d4af37; }
        .print-friendly { print-color-adjust: exact; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 print-friendly">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="gradient-bg text-white py-8 px-6">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-2">AFRICAN MOTHERS INITIATIVE (AMI)</h1>
            <p class="text-xl mb-4">HAPPINESS WOMEN PROGRESSIVE AND CAPACITY DEVELOPMENT ORGANISATION</p>
            <div class="bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-lg p-6 mt-6">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2 gold-accent">OFFICIAL PROGRAM & BUDGET PROPOSAL</h2>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-sm">
                    <div><strong>EVENT:</strong> All Women Interstate Debate & Celebration</div>
                    <div><strong>DATES:</strong> 7th – 9th July 2025</div>
                    <div><strong>VENUE:</strong> Abuja, Nigeria</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
        <!-- Appreciation Note -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-purple-800 mb-4 flex items-center">
                <span class="mr-3">💜</span>APPRECIATION NOTE
            </h3>
            <div class="bg-purple-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
                <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    <strong>To Our Dearest Mommy and Distinguished National Leader of Women,</strong>
                </p>
                <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    We heartily congratulate and appreciate you for your unwavering support and the success of the ongoing Free Medical Projects across our states. Your selfless service is setting a high standard for leadership and love.
                </p>
                <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                    As we prepare for the All Women Interstate Debate, which promises to unite, empower, and project the voice of African women nationwide, we respectfully present our program plan and budget below, trusting in your continued support and leadership.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Program Overview -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-purple-800 mb-6 flex items-center">
                <span class="mr-3">🎯</span>PROGRAM OVERVIEW
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
                The All Women Interstate Debate is a three-day empowerment and unity event designed to:
            </p>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-1 gap-4">
                <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
                    <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></div>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">Foster intellectual engagement and leadership among women across Nigeria.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
                    <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></div>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">Strengthen state-level collaboration through healthy debate and solution-building.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
                    <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></div>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">Honour and project the leadership image of our National Matron and African Mother General, Her Excellency (Mommy).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-4 mt-6">
                <p class="text-gray-700 font-medium">
                    This high-level engagement will be broadcast nationally, promoting your legacy across every state and region.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Budget Breakdown -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
