                            <th class="border border-purple-300 px-4 py-3 text-right font-semibold text-purple-800">Amount (₦)</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 font-medium">Venue (Hall)</td>
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3">
                                Advance paid: ₦500,000<br>
                                Balance: ₦2,500,000
                            </td>
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 text-right font-semibold">₦3,000,000</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 font-medium">Hotel Accommodation</td>
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3">
                                Booking deposit: ₦100,000<br>
                                Balance: ₦1,900,000
                            </td>
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 text-right font-semibold">₦2,000,000</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 font-medium">Catering & Refreshments</td>
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3">
                                2-day packs @ ₦5,500 per person (includes drinks, food, water, gift bags): ₦11,000,000<br>
                                Additional for hotel meals and post-thanksgiving refreshment: ₦2,000,000
                            </td>
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 text-right font-semibold">₦13,000,000</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 font-medium">Media & Publicity</td>
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3">Full coverage: live streaming, news agency coordination, post-production</td>
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 text-right font-semibold">₦5,000,000</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 font-medium">Debate Prizes</td>
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3">Awards and main winner prizes</td>
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 text-right font-semibold">₦5,000,000</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 font-medium">Logistics & Support</td>
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3">Consolation prizes, state executive transportation, return support, and office space provision in Abuja</td>
                            <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 text-right font-semibold">₦10,000,000</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="bg-purple-100 font-bold">
                            <td class="border border-purple-300 px-4 py-3 text-purple-800">TOTAL BUDGET</td>
                            <td class="border border-purple-300 px-4 py-3"></td>
                            <td class="border border-purple-300 px-4 py-3 text-right text-purple-800 text-lg">₦38,000,000</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Program Impact -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-purple-800 mb-6 flex items-center">
                <span class="mr-3">🌟</span>PROGRAM IMPACT AND VISION
            </h3>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <div class="text-center p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg">
                    <div class="text-3xl mb-3">📺</div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-2">National Broadcast</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Your name and vision will be carried to every state and LGA through our media strategy.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-lg">
                    <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🏛️</div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2">Legacy Building</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">This will affirm your position not just as the First Lady of a state, but as a continental mother and national women's leader.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center p-4 bg-orange-50 rounded-lg">
                    <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🏢</div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-orange-800 mb-2">Sustainability</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">The office space secured in Abuja will serve as a coordination center for all AMI-related development projects and training for women across Nigeria.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Funding Request -->
        <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center">
                <span class="mr-3">🙏</span>FUNDING REQUEST
            </h3>
            <div class="bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-lg p-6">
                <p class="mb-4 text-lg">
                    We humbly request your kind financial support in the total sum of <strong class="gold-accent text-2xl">₦38,000,000</strong> to successfully execute and celebrate this impactful program in your honour.
                </p>
                <p class="text-sm">
                    All disbursements will be accounted for with detailed reconciliation and documentation submitted to your esteemed office after the event.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Account Details -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-purple-800 mb-6 flex items-center">
                <span class="mr-3">🏦</span>ACCOUNT DETAILS
            </h3>
            <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-1">Account Name</p>
                        <p class="font-semibold">AMI HAPPINESS WOMEN PROGRESSIVE & CAPACITY DEVELOPMENT ORGANISATION</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-1">Account Number</p>
                        <p class="font-semibold text-lg">5601348798</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-1">Bank</p>
                        <p class="font-semibold">Fidelity Bank PLC</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Closing Remarks -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-purple-800 mb-6 flex items-center">
                <span class="mr-3">💝</span>CLOSING REMARKS
            </h3>
            <div class="bg-purple-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
                <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    <strong>Dearest Mommy,</strong> we believe this celebration will not only elevate our voices but also immortalize your impact across Nigeria. Your leadership has already touched thousands — this event will extend your legacy across borders and into the future.
                </p>
                <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    We believe God will use you to make this vision a reality. Thank you always for being our Governor's wife, our mentor, our Matron — and our National Leader.
                </p>
                <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                    God bless you, and God bless Nigeria.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-8 text-right">
                <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2"><strong>With sincere love and gratitude,</strong></p>
                <p class="text-purple-800 font-semibold text-lg">Margaret Mkpanam</p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">On behalf of: African Mothers Initiative (AMI)</p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Women Progress, Unity & Empowerment Team</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Print Button -->
        <div class="text-center mb-8">
            <button onclick="window.print()" class="bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold shadow-lg transition-colors duration-200">
                🖨️ Print Proposal
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-gray-800 text-white py-6 text-center">
        <p class="text-sm">© 2024 African Mothers Initiative (AMI) - Empowering Women Across Nigeria</p>
